Added immediate mod-list search by name, author, description, or version.

Separated safe load-order suggestions from [b]Check issues[/b], an on-demand report with exact shared files and compatibility details.

Made warnings and successful-install status more compact, with details available on hover and in the issue report.

Fixed Select all / Deselect all for large mod lists so it no longer repeats expensive checks per mod.

Added read-only validation for legacy cosmetic definitions and stopped reporting their shared category icon as a false file conflict.
